# Per-Dockerfile override for the bank-app build. The repo-root
# `.dockerignore` is tuned for the JVM service images (which only
# need a pre-built uberjar) and explicitly excludes `bases/bank-app`
# and `infra/docker` — both of which the SPA build needs. Buildx
# picks up `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` ahead of the root one when
# present, so this file is consulted only for the bank-app target.

# Start by excluding everything, then whitelist the minimum the
# multi-stage build actually copies.
*

# Yarn workspace root manifests. Yarn validates the whole workspace
# graph at install time, so every workspace member's package.json
# must be present even though only bank-app + bank-ui source gets
# COPY-ed below.
!package.json
!yarn.lock
!.yarnrc.yml
!bases/bank-console/package.json
!bases/bank-app
!components/bank-ui
!infra/docker/bank-app

# Re-exclude per-brick build artefacts inside the whitelisted dirs.
# Yarn 4 hoists node_modules to the workspace root, but stray
# per-brick caches from a host `yarn dev` session can still appear.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.svelte-kit
**/.vite
**/*.log
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
